Package: optee-test-k3
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, tee-supplicant
Conflicts: optee-test-qemu
Description: OP-TEE sanity test suite for TI K3 platforms
 OP-TEE is a Trusted Execution Environment designed as a companion to a
 non-secure Linux kernel running on Arm processors using TrustZone.
 .
 This package provides the OP-TEE xtest test application, test Trusted
 Applications, and tee-supplicant test plugin built for Texas Instruments
 K3 platforms.
